    { q: "In summary, tourism planning and development are:", options: ["Essential for creating sustainable, competitive and beneficial tourism", "Only about building hotels", "Only marketing", "Only increasing arrivals"], ans: "Essential for creating sustainable, competitive and beneficial tourism", topic: "Tourism Planning and Development" }
